  "questions": [
    {
      "QuestionID": 442796,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10705,
      "TopicRef": "3",
      "TopicName": "3 DAFFODILS",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>I <strong>wandered</strong> lonely as a cloud<br />\r\nThat floats on high o'er <strong>vales</strong> and hills,<br />\r\nWhen all at once I saw a crowd,<br />\r\nA <strong>host</strong> of golden daffodils;<br />\r\nBeside the lake, beneath the trees<br />\r\n<strong>Fluttering</strong> and dancing in the breeze.</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442797,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10705,
      "TopicRef": "3",
      "TopicName": "3 DAFFODILS",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p><strong>Continuous</strong> as the stars that shine</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And twinkle on the <strong>milky way</strong>,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>They stretched in never-ending line</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Along the margin of a bay:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ten thousand saw I at a glance</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tossing their heads in <strong>sprightly</strong> dance</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442798,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10705,
      "TopicRef": "3",
      "TopicName": "3 DAFFODILS",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>The waves besides them danced, but they</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Out-did the sparkling wave in glee:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A poet could not but be gay,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In such a <strong>jocund</strong> company!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I gazed - and gazed - but little thought</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What wealth the show to me had brought.</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442799,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10705,
      "TopicRef": "3",
      "TopicName": "3 DAFFODILS",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>For oft, when on my couch I lie</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In <strong>vacant</strong> or in <strong>pensive</strong> mood,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>They flash upon that inward eye</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Which is the <strong>bliss</strong> of <strong>solitude</strong>;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And then my heart with pleasure fills</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And dances with the daffodils.</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442800,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>If you can keep your head when all about you</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Are losing theirs and blaming it on you</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you can trust yourself when all men doubt you,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>But make allowance for their doubting too;</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442801,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>If you can wait and not be tired by waiting</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Or being lied about, don't deal in lies,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Or being hated, don't give way to hating,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And yet don't look too good, nor talk too wise:</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442802,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>If you can dream -  and not make dreams your master;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you can think - and not make thoughts your aim;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you can meet with <strong>Triumph</strong> and <strong>Disaster</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>An treat those two <strong>impostors</strong> just the same;</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442803,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>If you can bear to hear the truth you've spoken</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Twisted by <strong>knaves</strong> to make a trap for fools,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Or watch the things you gave your life to, broken</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And <strong>stoop</strong> and build 'em up with worn-out tools:</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442804,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>If you can make one heap of all your winnings</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And risk it on one turn of pitch-and-toss,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And lose, and start again at your beginnings</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And never breathe a word about you loss;</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442805,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>If you can force your heart and nerve and <strong>sinew</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>To serve your turn long after they are gone,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And so hold on when there is nothing in you</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Except the Will which says to them: 'Hold on!'</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442806,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>Íf you can talk with crowds and keep your <strong>virtue</strong>,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Or walk with Kings-nor lose the common touch,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If neither foes nor loving friends can hurt you,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If all men count with you, but none too much;</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
      "MultipleOptions": [],
      "_exportMeta": {
        "subTypeId": 47,
        "bankType": "long",
        "field": "POEM_STANZA",
        "exportName": "long-poem-stanzas"
      }
    },
    {
      "QuestionID": 442807,
      "SubjectID": 48,
      "TopicID": 10709,
      "TopicRef": "7",
      "TopicName": "7 IF",
      "QuestionPeriority": "Additional",
      "UrduQuestionDetails": null,
      "EnglishQuestionDetails": "<p>If you can fill the unforgiving minute</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With sixty seconds' worth of distance run,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Yours is the Earth and everything that's in it,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And-which is more-you'll be a Man, my son!</p>\r\n",
      "UrduFillAnswer": null,
      "EnglishFillAnswer": null,
      "TrueFalseAnswer": false,
      "IsSameMcq": false,
